Il Transeuropa Festival ho lö mincha duos ans ed es ün evenimaint / forum / üna conferenza politica, culturela ed artistica chi collia bgers differents formats. Nus, l'organisaziun European Alternatives chi sto davousvart, fains que uossa daspö 10 ans. Nus vains dimena fingià bgera experientscha. I's tratta d'ün evenimaint ambulant chi ho lö mincha vouta in ün'otra citad. L'ültima vouta, avaunt duos ans, d'eirana a Belgrad, dimena in üna citad dadour l'Uniun Europeica. Quist an, 2017, vulaivans ir a Madrid pervi da bgers differents motivs.
